      },
      "source": [
        "**Metric 1**: Portfolio Growth: Scaling from 8,935 to **20,742** loans **(+132% **growth).\n",
        "\n",
        "**Metric 2**: Arrears Rate: Peaked at **28.96% **in June before stabilizing slightly at **27.75%** in December.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Metric 3:** Collection Efficiency: Decreased from **75.29% to 72.33%,** showing that the collections team is under strain from the rapid volume increase.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Key Insight (FPD):** While the FPD Rate is high **(31.7%)**, it has improved significantly from **42.1% **in January. This proves that credit vetting is getting better, even as the company grows, but the rapid 132% scale is currently overwhelming our collections capacity."
      ]
    },
